---
layout: base
title: Free Tech Checkup
permalink: /free-checkup/
description: Free 20-minute Tech Checkup for Tampa Bay businesses. We review your website, booking flow and Google profile, then send a written report with the fixes ranked.
---

{% set checkup = null %}
{% for p in packages.all %}
  {% if p.id == "checkup" %}{% set checkup = p %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<section class="px-4 pb-8 pt-12 md:pb-10 md:pt-16">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Free. 20 minutes. No obligation.</p>
    <h1 class="h-display mt-4 max-w-3xl">Get a <span class="text-brand-gradient">free checkup</span> of your website, booking and Google listing</h1>
    <p class="lede mt-5 max-w-2xl">Send the short form. We'll set up a 20-minute call, look at how your website, booking flow and Google profile work today, and send you a written report with the fixes ranked.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 pb-16 md:pb-20">
  <div class="wrap grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-12">

    <div class="md:col-span-2">
      <h2 class="h-section">What we check and what you get</h2>
      {% if checkup %}
      <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3">
        {% for item in checkup.includes %}
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span aria-hidden="true" class="font-bold text-indigo-700">&#10003;</span>
          <span>{{ item }}</span>
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 font-semibold text-gray-900">{{ checkup.price }}: {{ checkup.priceNote }}.</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">{{ checkup.timeline }}.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <div class="card">
        {% set formSource = "free-checkup" %}
        {% set formHeading = "Request your free checkup" %}
        {% set formButton = "Request my free checkup" %}
        {% set showSiteUrl = true %}
        {% include "partials/lead-form.njk" %}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">What happens next</h2>
    <ol class="mt-8 list-decimal space-y-4 pl-6 text-lg marker:font-bold marker:text-indigo-700">
      <li><strong>You send the form.</strong> It's short, and you can skip anything marked optional.</li>
      <li><strong>We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}</strong> to set a time. {{ site.callHours }}.</li>
      <li><strong>We have a 20-minute call.</strong> You tell us how your business runs and what's frustrating. We tell you what we've seen so far.</li>
      <li><strong>You get a written report.</strong> It's in plain English, with your fixes ranked.{% if checkup %} {{ checkup.timeline }}.{% endif %}</li>
      <li><strong>You decide what, if anything, to do.</strong> You can fix things yourself, hire us, or do nothing.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">What the report covers</h2>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6">
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Mobile and speed</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">How your website loads and reads on a phone, since that's where many customers will first see it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Accessibility of key pages</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">An automated scan and a hands-on check of your main pages against WCAG 2.1 AA: labels, contrast, alt text, headings and keyboard use.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 text-gray-700">This is a technical review, not legal advice. Mobius is not a law firm.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Booking and contact flow</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">We try to book or get in touch the way a customer would, start to finish, and note anywhere it breaks or confuses.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">Google profile</h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-gray-700">Whether your Google Business Profile is complete, accurate and consistent with your website.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-gray-50">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="h-section">No strings</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-700">The report is yours whether or not you ever hire us. There's no contract to sign and no card to put down. If a fix is something you can do yourself, we'll say so.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-gray-700">Would you rather talk first? <a class="link" href="/contact/">Send us a message instead</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
